            "content": "<p>Slim and tailored, with room drafted through the seat and thigh, then a clean taper from knee to ankle. A sharp line that holds all day.</p><p>If you train and sit between sizes, take the smaller waist. The stretch twill gives one to two centimetres within the first week of wear, so there is no need to size up for the leg.</p><p>Machine wash cold, hang to dry, no ironing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab2": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Details",
            "content": "<p>Cotton twill blended with elastane, finished to resist wrinkles. A smooth face, natural drape, and a fabric that recovers instead of holding the knee you were sitting in.</p><p>Seams are reinforced at every stress point. Metal hardware rather than coated plastic. Two rear welt pockets, two slanted side pockets, and a hidden coin pocket at the waistband.</p><p>Designed in Brisbane. 97% cotton, 3% elastane.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
